White Buffalo — rights notice for this repository

Copyright (c) 2026 Ben Cohen and Daniel Klein. All rights reserved.

This repository is the book *White Buffalo* and its complete working
record: manuscript drafts, working notes and planning ledgers, the
illustration pipeline and its outputs, and transcripts of the writing
sessions. Making the record public is part of the project; publishing
it here does not place any of it in the public domain or grant a
general license to reuse it.

That said, plainly: brief quotation from any of these materials — the
book's text, the notes, the transcripts, the images — for purposes of
review, commentary, criticism, scholarship, or reporting is welcome,
exactly as it is for the book itself. In the United States, fair use
already permits this without our blessing; we state it anyway so that
no one is deterred by the notice above. Attribution to the book and,
where relevant, to the repository is appreciated.

Anything beyond brief quotation — republication, redistribution,
derivative works, training uses, or reproduction of the plates at
full resolution — requires written permission from the authors.

This notice is a placeholder posture, deliberately conservative; the
authors may loosen it in a later revision.
